WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.334 --> 00:00:03.754
♪ "If" and "then"
are two regular words ♪

00:00:03.754 --> 00:00:08.884
♪ that work together
exquisitely. ♪

00:00:08.884 --> 00:00:12.304
♪ If I can show you
by singing this song, ♪

00:00:12.304 --> 00:00:16.558
♪ then you'll
remember it easily. ♪

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:20.312
♪ I'll give you a tool
that starts with a rule ♪

00:00:20.312 --> 00:00:24.191
♪ to tell you what the next
thing you do ought to be. ♪

00:00:24.191 --> 00:00:25.943
♪ Now listen carefully! ♪

00:00:25.943 --> 00:00:27.945
♪ If the weather
is sunny... ♪

00:00:27.945 --> 00:00:30.197
♪ ...then wear a cap. ♪

00:00:30.197 --> 00:00:32.241
♪ If you want to go hiking... ♪

00:00:32.241 --> 00:00:34.576
♪...then get a map. ♪

00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:36.620
♪ If you picture
these two words... ♪

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:38.789
♪ ...then it's
an easy decision. ♪

00:00:38.789 --> 00:00:41.416
♪ If there was ever a time
to get down, ♪

00:00:41.416 --> 00:00:43.210
♪ then this is one. ♪

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:45.170
♪ If the music is off,
then turn it on. ♪

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:47.506
♪ If the music is on,
then turn it up. ♪

00:00:47.506 --> 00:00:49.549
♪ If the music is up,
then hit the floor. ♪

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:52.552
♪ And if you're on the floor,
then dance. ♪

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:55.472
♪ "If" and "then"
are two regular words ♪

00:00:55.472 --> 00:01:00.602
♪ but what a marvelous job
they do. ♪

00:01:00.602 --> 00:01:04.106
♪ If there's a part
with an "if" at the start, ♪

00:01:04.106 --> 00:01:08.360
♪ find out if
what's in that part is true. ♪

00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:10.070
♪ Now wasn't that fun? ♪

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:12.114
♪ You're practically done... ♪

00:01:12.114 --> 00:01:14.032
♪...because the "then"
part tells you ♪

00:01:14.032 --> 00:01:16.118
♪ what you ought to do. ♪

00:01:16.118 --> 00:01:17.911
♪ Now you can try it too. ♪

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:19.746
♪ If it's finally
snack time... ♪

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:22.124
♪ ...then have some fruit. ♪

00:01:22.124 --> 00:01:24.042
♪ If today 
is your birthday... ♪

00:01:24.042 --> 00:01:26.586
♪ ...then give a toot. ♪
[HORN HONKS]

