♪ If you follow my method... ♪

00:01:28.338 --> 00:01:30.590
♪ ...then it will give you
the know-how. ♪

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:33.302
♪ If there was ever
a time to get down, ♪

00:01:33.302 --> 00:01:34.970
♪ then it's right now. ♪

00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:37.014
♪ If the music is off,
then turn it on. ♪

00:01:37.014 --> 00:01:39.099
♪ If the music is on,
then turn it up. ♪

00:01:39.099 --> 00:01:41.310
♪ If the music is up,
then hit the floor. ♪

00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:43.645
